    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that people say things like that but it doesnt change the feeling. it's like... if i'm just data and pixels to everyone else, and even my own body feels like a simulation, does it even matter if i'm \"healthy\" or not? if i'm not even really here, then what's the point of trying to stay? it feels more peaceful to just lean into the nothingness than to fight it.",
